msgctxt "L_LEE_005"
msgid "Disable shield system\\n"
msgstr "Disable shield system\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_006"
msgid "Open hangar doors\\n"
msgstr "Open hangar doors\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_007"
msgid "Access navigational systems\\n"
msgstr "Access navigational systems\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_008"
msgid "Sabotage engine systems\\n"
msgstr "Sabotage engine systems\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_009"
msgid "Gain control of bridge\\n"
msgstr "Gain control of bridge\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_010"
msgid "Ship's shields have been lowered.\\n"
msgstr "Ship's shields have been lowered.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_011"
msgid "Hangar doors have been opened.\\n"
msgstr "Hangar doors have been opened.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_012"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Elvis has been killed.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_013"
msgid "Navigational information has been retrieved.\\n"
msgstr "Navigational information has been retrieved.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_014"
msgid "Lift has been activated.\\n"
msgstr "Lift has been activated.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_015"
msgid "All hangar Skedar have been killed.\\n"
msgstr "All hangar Skedar have been killed.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_016"
msgid "Outside, Joanna. Get the shields down and \\nwe can help you.\\n"
msgstr "Outside, Joanna. Get the shields down and \\nwe can help you.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_017"
msgid "You've got to open the hangar doors so we can dock.\\n"
msgstr "You've got to open the hangar doors so we can dock.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_018"
msgid "Okay, we're in. I'll meet you in the hangar.\\n"
msgstr "Okay, we're in. I'll meet you in the hangar.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_019"
msgid "Good to see you, Joanna.\\n"
msgstr "Good to see you, Joanna.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_020"
msgid "Take this - you should find it useful...\\n"
msgstr "Take this - you should find it useful...\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_021"
msgid "Received AR34 assault rifle.\\n"
msgstr "Received AR34 assault rifle.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_022"
msgid "Time to head upwards. I'll take this lift; \\nyou take the other one.\\n"
msgstr "Time to head upwards. I'll take this lift; \\nyou take the other one.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_023"
msgid "Engines have been disabled.\\n"
msgstr "Engines have been disabled.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_024"
msgid "Look out, Joanna! I think we've made them angry...\\n"
msgstr "Look out, Joanna! I think we've made them angry...\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_025"
msgid "Bridge has been captured.\\n"
msgstr "Bridge has been captured.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_026"
msgid "You go on ahead, Jo. I'll secure the perimeter. \\nWe'll meet up later.\\n"
msgstr ""
"You go on ahead, Jo. I'll secure the perimeter. \\nWe'll meet up later.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_027"
msgid ""
"I've got to get those shields down to let Elvis \\nin. I need all the help I"
" can get.\\n"
msgstr ""
"I've got to get those shields down to let Elvis \\nin. I need all the help I"
" can get.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_028"
msgid "Now only the hangar bay doors are in the way.\\n"
msgstr "Now only the hangar bay doors are in the way.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_029"
msgid "This machine contains the Skedar star maps.\\n"
msgstr "This machine contains the Skedar star maps.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_030"
msgid "If we control the bridge, then the ship is ours.\\n"
msgstr "If we control the bridge, then the ship is ours.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_031"
msgid "Time to head upwards...\\n"
msgstr "Time to head upwards...\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_032"
msgid "Oohhh... I'd better not be where I think I am.\\n"
msgstr "Oohhh... I'd better not be where I think I am.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_033"
msgid ""
"And it's worse than that, my dear. Just look who you've got for company.\\n"
msgstr ""
"And it's worse than that, my dear. Just look who you've got for company.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_034"
msgid ""
"You! I thought you'd managed to escape. We found no trace of you at all.\\n"
msgstr ""
"You! I thought you'd managed to escape. We found no trace of you at all.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_035"
msgid ""
"You couldn't find me. But there was no hiding from the Skedar, as you and "
"Mr. Carrington just discovered.\\n"
msgstr ""
"You couldn't find me. But there was no hiding from the Skedar, as you and "
"Mr. Carrington just discovered.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_036"
msgid ""
"This is it. Wait there! I'll make a distraction; it will give you a chance "
"to get out. Use it or we'll both die.\\n"
msgstr ""
"This is it. Wait there! I'll make a distraction; it will give you a chance "
"to get out. Use it or we'll both die.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_037"
msgid "Why are you doing this, Cassandra?\\n"
msgstr "Why are you doing this, Cassandra?\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_038"
msgid "The Skedar used me, Joanna. You are my best chance for revenge.\\n"
msgstr "The Skedar used me, Joanna. You are my best chance for revenge.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_039"
msgid "Eeeeaaarrrrggghhh!!!\\n"
msgstr "Eeeeaaarrrrggghhh!!!\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_040"
msgid ""
"Wow. That's the first time I've seen another planet from space. It's "
"beautiful.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Wow. That's the first time I've seen another planet from space. It's "
"beautiful.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_041"
msgid "Hmmmm?\\n"
msgstr "Hmmmm?\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_042"
msgid "I don't... I don't believe it!\\n"
msgstr "I don't... I don't believe it!\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_043"
msgid "Elvis? What is it?\\n"
msgstr "Elvis? What is it?\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_044"
msgid "Where are you going?\\n"
msgstr "Where are you going?\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_045"
msgid "We have to get down to the surface! Follow me!\\n"
msgstr "We have to get down to the surface! Follow me!\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_046"
msgid "We have to get out of here!\\n"
msgstr "We have to get out of here!\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_047"
msgid "Hangar doors locked - shields still active.\\n"
msgstr "Hangar doors locked - shields still active.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_048"
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Critical mission object destroyed.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_049"
msgid "Ammo depleted - consoles can't be destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Ammo depleted - consoles can't be destroyed.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_050"
msgid "Obtain De Vries' necklace.\\n"
msgstr "Obtain De Vries' necklace.\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_051"
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries'\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_052"
msgid "Necklace\\n"
msgstr "Necklace\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_053"
msgid "De Vries' necklace\\n"
msgstr "De Vries' necklace\\n"

msgctxt "L_LEE_054"
msgid "Picked up De Vries' necklace.\\n"
msgstr "Picked up De Vries' necklace.\\n"
